    "detailed_description": "<i><u>Disclaimer:</u></i> Downloading this free game will make you legally obliged to buy any subsequent sequels.<br><br>Welcome to Garden of Pizzlerat, the ultimate indie horror/puzzle game that will challenge your mind and test your nerves. You play as a person, a brave adventurer who finds themselves trapped in Pizzlerats's Garden with no way out. But don't worry \u2013 you have a secret weapon: The CheesePlacer.<br><br><strong>The garden.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409450/extras/7fab7d3272723bdbf9bd54c9681d3d27.avif?t=1685996824\" /></span><br>Pizzlerat's garden was once a beautiful and thriving place, until one day, all the inhabitants mysteriously vanished without a trace. Now, years later, you must explore the overgrown garden and uncover the truth behind its deserted state.<br><br><strong>Characters.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409450/extras/a02d898a616a07092064894d9fd762fc.avif?t=1685996824\" /></span><br>Prepare to embark on a journey like no other, where you'll encounter a vast array of iconic characters - from heroes to villains and everyone in between. You'll have the chance to talk with thousands of fascinating personas - Such as: Pizzlerat. (end of list).<br><br><strong>Platforming.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409450/extras/230117e5ae2c4bc38d0f9cf251b94dbd.avif?t=1685996824\" /></span><br>There are many holes and pits and other stuff like that. So you have to jump.<br><br><strong>The CheesePlacer.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409450/extras/f1a032454ce1cf1abac950cd1275e4bd.avif?t=1685996824\" /></span><br>The CheesePlacer\u2122\u00ae\u00a9 is an innovative tool designed to assist you in solving puzzles and overcoming obstacles in exciting and challenging puzzles. By dispensing delicious cheese onto the ground, the CheesePlacer\u2122\u00ae\u00a9 can attract nearby rats, which can be used to trigger nearby buttons.",
